{"ref":"BDB, עַזְגָּד","hw":"עַזְגָּד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַזְגָּד</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Ασγαδ, Αζγαδ <strong>(</strong><em>Gad is mighty;</em> Gray<sup>Prop. N. 145</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  head of family returning with Zerub. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:12\" href=\"/Ezra.2.12\">Ezr 2:12</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.17\">Ne 7:17</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  returning with Ezra <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:12\" href=\"/Ezra.8.12\">Ezr 8:12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  one of those sealed <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:16\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.16\">Ne 10:16</a>.","next":"BDB, עַזְמָ֫וֶת","prev":"BDB, עַזְבּוּק²"}